msgctxt "180"
msgid "Hey, lady, can you tell me where Doc Emoto's clinic is at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Not even a response...? This ain't the city I remember. Or the people, for "
"that matter..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "(That guy's looking for Emoto Medical Clinic, huh?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Hey, you said you were looking for Doc Emoto's clinic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "That's right. Can you help me out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "I know where the clinic's at, but what is it you need from him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Well, the doc took good care of me in the past. Haven't been to this city in"
" fifteen years, and I'd like to drop by, say hello."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Think you could take me there? Hell, this city's changed so much, I don't "
"know which way is up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"To get there, go straight along this street, then take a left onto Taihei "
"Boulevard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Go straight and take a left, huh? Maybe it'll come back to me if I keep "
"walking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Thanks for the tip, pal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "You got it. Just follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You're gonna take me there? Hey, I appreciate that, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Take Him to Emoto Medical Clinic"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Tell Him Where the Clinic's At"
msgstr ""

